<BzBubble Variant="BubbleVariant.Muted" Class="max-w-md">
    <BzBubbleContent>
        <BzCollapsible>
            <div>
                The accessibility review found two focus states that were visually too subtle in dark
                mode, both on the settings screen.
            </div>
            <BzCollapsibleContent>
                <div class="mt-2">
                    The toggle rows relied on a faint outline that fails contrast on the dark surface,
                    and the danger-zone links had no visible focus at all. Both now use the shared
                    two-layer ring treatment and pass the audit.
                </div>
            </BzCollapsibleContent>
            <BzCollapsibleTrigger>
                <RenderAs Context="p">
                    <button type="button" @attributes="p.Attributes"
                            class="mt-1.5 text-xs font-medium underline underline-offset-4 data-[state=open]:hidden">
                        Show more
                    </button>
                </RenderAs>
            </BzCollapsibleTrigger>
        </BzCollapsible>
    </BzBubbleContent>
</BzBubble>
